<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <script src="https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6"></script>
    <script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 40px auto;
            max-width: 800px;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 12pt;
            color: #000;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        p, h1, h2, h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 24pt;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 18pt;
            margin-top: 24px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .placeholder {
            border: 2px dashed #999;
            background: #f9f9f9;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            position: relative;
        }

        .placeholder::before {
            content: "[Diagram]";
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            left: 10px;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }

        .signature {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            height: 80px;
            width: 200px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            display: inline-block;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Document Title</h1>

<p>Sample paragraph text for layout demonstration. This is a placeholder document created for demonstration purposes only. In a real conversion, all visible text would be extracted verbatim without any paraphrasing or summarization.</p>

<div class="placeholder" style="width: 400px; height: 300px; margin: 30px auto;">
    [Diagram: Centered placeholder for chart or image occupying the full width of the container]
</div>

<p>Additional text block positioned below the diagram to maintain spatial fidelity. Any unclear text would be marked as [?].</p>

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Column 1</th>
            <th>Column 2</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td>Row 1, Cell 1</td>
            <td>Row 1, Cell 2</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Row 2, Cell 1</td>
            <td>Row 2, Cell 2</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<div class="signature"></div>

<p>Signature line for formal documents, placed exactly where it appears in the original layout.</p>

</body>
</html>
